MIR JIT provides a private static-library CMake target:

  find_package(MIR CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE MIR::MIR)

The port intentionally packages only the MIR core/generator API.
C2MIR, MIR command-line tools, and upstream tests are not built.

Windows support is limited to x64. The same pinned upstream core/generator
and code-memory-limit patch are built with the consuming triplet's CRT.
32-bit Windows and Windows ARM64 are not admitted by this port.
